BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  Since this is a multi-round game, I want to signal cooperation while being somewhat cautious i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    n the first round. Sending a moderate amount allows us both to benefit from the 3x multiplie) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    r while I assess the receiver's trustworthiness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  I'll send $3, which becomes $9 for the receiver. This gives them a good opportunity to demonst) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    rate trustworthiness by returning a fair amount, and we can build mutual trust from there.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
